0016-gpui-webview-record.patch (combined series, 2026-11-13). Formerly 0016-gpui-webview-record.patch (original kept in nsh-host-patches/superseded-2026-11-13/).
Applies with patch -p1 at the root of a copy of nsh-host-allspeech-src after every earlier patch of the series 0010-0020, in order.

gpui: webview.recordStart / webview.recordStop (H.264 MP4 of a shown WKWebView page)

On top of 0015 (webview.capture). The page is snapshotted at the asked frame rate and the frames are appended to an
AVAssetWriter at their real time. recordStart { path, point?, frameRate? } resolves { path, frameRate };
recordStop resolves { path, mimeType, sizeBytes, width, height, frames, durationMs }. One recording at a time.
Links CoreGraphics, CoreVideo and AVFoundation (system frameworks); no new crate.

